{"id":"0a6da8c909717780","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-finite-words-and-languages.md","title":"Alphabets, Words, and Languages","display":"df-alphabet-word-language — Alphabets, Words, and Languages","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","aliases":["73-df-finite-words-and-languages","73-df-alphabet-word-language"],"display":"df-alphabet-word-language — Alphabets, Words, and Languages","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-finite-words-and-languages</span><span>73-df-alphabet-word-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-alphabet-word-language — Alphabets, Words, and Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是候选字母表集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是任意集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是有类型的空有限序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的定义不预设其左侧谓词成立。</li>\n<li>对每个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_X\">\\(\\mathcal S_X\\)</span> 是背景的有限序列载集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:\\mathcal S_X\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(|\\cdot|:\\mathcal S_X\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是长度函数；按位置求值是给定的背景函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,i)\\mapsto w(i):\\{(w,i)\\in\\mathcal S_X\\times\\mathbb N:i&lt;|w|\\}\\to X\">\\((w,i)\\mapsto w(i):\\{(w,i)\\in\\mathcal S_X\\times\\mathbb N:i&lt;|w|\\}\\to X\\)</span>；序列对象不与该求值函数的图识别。</li>\n<li>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\\to X\">\\(f:\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\\to X\\)</span>，存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathcal S_X\">\\(w\\in\\mathcal S_X\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|w|=n\">\\(|w|=n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;n\\;w(i)=f(i)\">\\(\\forall i&lt;n\\;w(i)=f(i)\\)</span>，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle f(i):0\\le i&lt;n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle f(i):0\\le i&lt;n\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\rangle\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始取值，元组投影从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 开始编号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|w|\">\\(|w|\\)</span> 在序列类型上表示长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|X|\">\\(|X|\\)</span> 在集合类型上表示基数。</li>\n<li>背景使用带类型的序列对象：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\notin\\mathbb N\">\\(\\varepsilon\\notin\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\varepsilon\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；对每个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in\\mathcal S_X\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in\\mathcal S_X\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\varepsilon|=0\">\\(|\\varepsilon|=0\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq Y\">\\(X\\subseteq Y\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_X\\subseteq\\mathcal S_Y\">\\(\\mathcal S_X\\subseteq\\mathcal S_Y\\)</span>，长度与位置求值在包含映射下相同。</li>\n<li>在一般序列运算子句中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in X\">\\(a,b\\in X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,w\\in\\mathcal S_X\">\\(u,v,w\\in\\mathcal S_X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathcal S_X}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathcal S_X}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，点值和投影只在显示的下标域内使用。不同子句中重新量化的变量独立绑定。</li>\n<li>在语言运算子句中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(A,B,L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；参与语言拼接的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 由各自的成员条件绑定。一般序列运算取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\Sigma\">\\(X=\\Sigma\\)</span> 时即为相同字母表上的词运算。</li>\n<li>区间子句取任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(r,s\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\le s\">\\(r\\le s\\)</span>；仅在有限串接子句中另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\le s\">\\(r\\le s\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:r\\le i&lt;s\\}\\to X^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(F:\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:r\\le i&lt;s\\}\\to X^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列、一般函数图及其各自的定义域和取值域使用声明的类型；带类型的同名运算是不同的类型实例。字符与单字符词不作隐式识别，集合标签本身不因此增加互斥限制。字符拼接和字符幂接口由 Assertion 中的公式给出；集合成员关系和等号中的单字符词显式写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>机器、文法及其全体等可以是可定义类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{M:P(M)\\}\">\\(\\{M:P(M)\\}\\)</span> 在该情形为类缩写，其成员公式按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(M)\">\\(P(M)\\)</span> 消去，不断言存在包含所有有限标签集合的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Sigma\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\notin\\Sigma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Sigma\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\notin\\Sigma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq X:|A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq X:|A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nX^n\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\mathcal S_X:|w|=n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}=\\mathcal S_X,\\qquad X^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^n,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\Sigma^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nX^n\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\mathcal S_X:|w|=n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,\\qquad\nX^{&lt;\\omega}=\\mathcal S_X,\\qquad X^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^n,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\Sigma^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\{r,\\ldots,s\\}\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:r\\le i\\le s\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;|w|\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(w)\\coloneqq\\{w(i):i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\{r,\\ldots,s\\}\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:r\\le i\\le s\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;|w|\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(w)\\coloneqq\\{w(i):i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\pi_j(w)\\coloneqq w(j-1)\\quad(1\\le j\\le|w|),\\qquad\nw_j\\coloneqq\\pi_j(w)\\quad(1\\le j\\le|w|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\pi_j(w)\\coloneqq w(j-1)\\quad(1\\le j\\le|w|),\\qquad\nw_j\\coloneqq\\pi_j(w)\\quad(1\\le j\\le|w|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nu\\mathbin{\\frown}v\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\begin{cases}\nu(i),&amp;0\\le i&lt;|u|,\\\\\nv(i-|u|),&amp;|u|\\le i&lt;|u|+|v|\n\\end{cases}\n:0\\le i&lt;|u|+|v|\n\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nu\\mathbin{\\frown}v\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\begin{cases}\nu(i),&amp;0\\le i&lt;|u|,\\\\\nv(i-|u|),&amp;|u|\\le i&lt;|u|+|v|\n\\end{cases}\n:0\\le i&lt;|u|+|v|\n\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n|u\\mathbin{\\frown}v|=|u|+|v|,\\qquad\n(u\\mathbin{\\frown}v)(i)=\n\\begin{cases}u(i),&amp;0\\le i&lt;|u|,\\\\v(i-|u|),&amp;|u|\\le i&lt;|u|+|v|\\end{cases}\n\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;|u|+|v|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n|u\\mathbin{\\frown}v|=|u|+|v|,\\qquad\n(u\\mathbin{\\frown}v)(i)=\n\\begin{cases}u(i),&amp;0\\le i&lt;|u|,\\\\v(i-|u|),&amp;|u|\\le i&lt;|u|+|v|\\end{cases}\n\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i&lt;|u|+|v|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nX^{n+1}=\\{u\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle:u\\in X^n\\land a\\in X\\}\n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\mathbf2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nX^{n+1}=\\{u\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle:u\\in X^n\\land a\\in X\\}\n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\mathbf2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nuv\\coloneqq u\\mathbin{\\frown}v,\\qquad\nw^R\\coloneqq\\langle w(|w|-1-i):0\\leq i&lt;|w|\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nuv\\coloneqq u\\mathbin{\\frown}v,\\qquad\nw^R\\coloneqq\\langle w(|w|-1-i):0\\leq i&lt;|w|\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nu^0\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\nu^{n+1}\\coloneqq u^n u\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nu^0\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\nu^{n+1}\\coloneqq u^n u\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA\\cdot B\\coloneqq\\{uv:u\\in A\\land v\\in B\\},\\qquad AB\\coloneqq A\\cdot B,\\qquad\nA^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad\nA^{n+1}\\coloneqq A^n\\cdot A\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA\\cdot B\\coloneqq\\{uv:u\\in A\\land v\\in B\\},\\qquad AB\\coloneqq A\\cdot B,\\qquad\nA^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad\nA^{n+1}\\coloneqq A^n\\cdot A\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n,\\qquad\nA^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}A^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n,\\qquad\nA^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}A^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nav\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}v,\\qquad\nua\\coloneqq u\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle,\\qquad\nab\\coloneqq\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\qquad\na^n\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle^n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nav\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}v,\\qquad\nua\\coloneqq u\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle,\\qquad\nab\\coloneqq\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\qquad\na^n\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle^n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X:(X^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\to X^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(U\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle w\\rangle)\n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Concat}_X(U)\\mathbin{\\frown}w\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X:(X^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\to X^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(U\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle w\\rangle)\n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Concat}_X(U)\\mathbin{\\frown}w\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=r}^{s-1}F(i)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(\\langle F(r+j):0\\le j&lt;s-r\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=r}^{s-1}F(i)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(\\langle F(r+j):0\\le j&lt;s-r\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon)\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\langle a\\rangle):a\\in\\Sigma\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}:\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\to\\Sigma^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon)\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\langle a\\rangle):a\\in\\Sigma\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}:\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\to\\Sigma^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Words are finite sequences over a nonempty finite alphabet; the ordered tuple defines reversal without leaving its length or domain implicit, and the recursion fixes word powers used in pumping arguments.</li>\n<li>Language concatenation and the two iteration closures now have explicit empty-product and successor clauses.</li>\n<li>The empty word is a sequence rather than an alphabet symbol, so epsilon transitions do not enlarge the input alphabet.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>序列载集与长度层先由背景有限序列构造给出，再定义串接；原空词、后继层、字符幂、词幂及所有串接结果不变。序列对象与自然数的类型分离保证二进制字母表及数值／词载体分支不发生重合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_X","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|:\\mathcal S_X\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(w,i)\\mapsto w(i):\\{(w,i)\\in\\mathcal S_X\\times\\mathbb N:i<|w|\\}\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<n\\}\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathcal S_X","display":false},{"tex":"|w|=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i<n\\;w(i)=f(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle f(i):0\\le i<n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"|w|","display":false},{"tex":"|X|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\notin\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in\\mathcal S_X","display":false},{"tex":"|\\varepsilon|=0","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_X\\subseteq\\mathcal S_Y","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,w\\in\\mathcal S_X","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathcal S_X}","display":false},{"tex":"n,i,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"u,v","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"r,s\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"r\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"r\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:r\\le i<s\\}\\to X^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\{M:P(M)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Sigma\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\Sigma|<\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\notin\\Sigma","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq X:|A|<\\aleph_0\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nX^n\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\mathcal S_X:|w|=n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\nX^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X^n,\\qquad\nX^{<\\omega}=\\mathcal S_X,\\qquad X^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad\n\\Sigma^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^n,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\Sigma^n","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\{r,\\ldots,s\\}\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:r\\le i\\le s\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<|w|\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(w)\\coloneqq\\{w(i):i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(w)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\pi_j(w)\\coloneqq w(j-1)\\quad(1\\le j\\le|w|),\\qquad\nw_j\\coloneqq\\pi_j(w)\\quad(1\\le j\\le|w|)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nu\\mathbin{\\frown}v\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\n\\begin{cases}\nu(i),&0\\le i<|u|,\\\\\nv(i-|u|),&|u|\\le i<|u|+|v|\n\\end{cases}\n:0\\le i<|u|+|v|\n\\right\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n|u\\mathbin{\\frown}v|=|u|+|v|,\\qquad\n(u\\mathbin{\\frown}v)(i)=\n\\begin{cases}u(i),&0\\le i<|u|,\\\\v(i-|u|),&|u|\\le i<|u|+|v|\\end{cases}\n\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i<|u|+|v|)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nX^{n+1}=\\{u\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle:u\\in X^n\\land a\\in X\\}\n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\mathbf2)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Lang}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nuv\\coloneqq u\\mathbin{\\frown}v,\\qquad\nw^R\\coloneqq\\langle w(|w|-1-i):0\\leq i<|w|\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nu^0\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\nu^{n+1}\\coloneqq u^n u\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA\\cdot B\\coloneqq\\{uv:u\\in A\\land v\\in B\\},\\qquad AB\\coloneqq A\\cdot B,\\qquad\nA^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad\nA^{n+1}\\coloneqq A^n\\cdot A\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n,\\qquad\nA^+\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}A^n","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nav\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}v,\\qquad\nua\\coloneqq u\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle,\\qquad\nab\\coloneqq\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\qquad\na^n\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle^n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X:(X^{<\\omega})^{<\\omega}\\to X^{<\\omega},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(U\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle w\\rangle)\n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Concat}_X(U)\\mathbin{\\frown}w","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=r}^{s-1}F(i)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Concat}_X(\\langle F(r+j):0\\le j<s-r\\rangle)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet\\text{-}word\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon)\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\langle a\\rangle):a\\in\\Sigma\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma}:\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\to\\Sigma^*","display":true}],"bytes":7075,"backlinks":[{"id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}$ (binary alphabet; word operations are from [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])"},{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$；二进制词、单字符词及拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。"},{"id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$；关系的两个参数均为句型词，字符 $A$ 的拼接由 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]] 的显式重载解释。"},{"id":"c57bbf0a680e199a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$；关系的两个参数均为句型词，字符 $A$ 的拼接由 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]] 的显式重载解释。"},{"id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。"},{"id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (termi